\">\\bar{P}_{ij}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.1062em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8201em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span></span><span style=\"top:-3.2523em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.1667em;\"><span class=\"mord\">ˉ</span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0572em;\">ij</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是标注的真实概率（相关 → 1，不相关 → 0，相等 → 0.5）。</p>\n<p><strong>LambdaRank</strong>（Burges et al., 2006）：直接定义「梯度」而非损失函数，对 RankNet 梯度乘以 NDCG 变化量 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi><msub><mtext>NDCG</mtext><mrow><mi>i</mi><mi>j</mi></mrow></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">|\\Delta\\text{NDCG}_{ij}|</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0361em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">∣Δ</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">NDCG</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0572em;\">ij</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\">∣</span></span></span></span></span>，使模型优化更关注对 NDCG 影响大的文档对：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>λ</mi><mrow><mi>i</mi><mi>j</mi></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∂</mi><msub><mi>L</mi><mrow><mi>i</mi><mi>j</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∂</mi><msub><mi>s</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow></mfrac><mo>⋅</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi><msub><mtext>NDCG</mtext><mrow><mi>i</mi><mi>j</mi></mrow></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\lambda_{ij} = \\frac{\\partial L_{ij}}{\\partial s_i} \\cdot |\\Delta\\text{NDCG}_{ij}|</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9805em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">λ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0572em;\">ij</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.2074em;vertical-align:-0.836em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3714em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\" style=\"margin-right:0.0556em;\">∂</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\" style=\"margin-right:0.0556em;\">∂</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0572em;\">ij</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.836em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0361em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">∣Δ</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">NDCG</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0572em;\">ij</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\">∣</span></span></span></span></span></div><h2 id=\"listwise-直接优化排序指标\">Listwise：直接优化排序指标</h2><p>Listwise 方法将整个文档列表作为训练单元，直接优化 NDCG、MAP 等排序指标。</p>\n<p><strong>LambdaMART</strong>（Wu et al., 2010）：LambdaRank + MART（Multiple Additive Regression Trees），是目前工业界最主流的 LTR 算法之一：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"text\" data-code=\"LambdaMART 训练流程：&#10;  for round m = 1, ..., M:&#10;    1. 计算每个 query-doc 对的 λ 梯度（LambdaRank 梯度）&#10;    2. 拟合一棵回归决策树到 λ 梯度&#10;    3. 通过 line search 确定叶节点得分&#10;    4. 将新树加入 ensemble&#10;&#10;最终模型：F(x) = Σ α_m · h_m(x)\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>LambdaMART 训练流程：</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  for round m = 1, ..., M:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    1. 计算每个 query-doc 对的 λ 梯度（LambdaRank 梯度）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    2. 拟合一棵回归决策树到 λ 梯度</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    3. 通过 line search 确定叶节点得分</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    4. 将新树加入 ensemble</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>最终模型：F(x) = Σ α_m · h_m(x)</span></span></code></pre></div><p><strong>ApproxNDCG</strong>（Qin et al., 2010）：通过 Sigmoid 近似 NDCG 中的排序位置，使 NDCG 变为可微，直接用梯度下降优化。</p>\n<p><strong>三范式对比</strong>：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>方法</th>\n<th>优化目标</th>\n<th>训练样本单元</th>\n<th>典型算法</th>\n<th>适用场景</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>Pointwise</td>\n<td>绝对得分 MSE</td>\n<td>单文档</td>\n<td>Ridge Regression, Gradient Boosting</td>\n<td>标注少，快速基线</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Pairwise</td>\n<td>文档对偏序</td>\n<td>文档对</td>\n<td>RankNet, LambdaRank</td>\n<td>有成对偏好数据</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Listwise</td>\n<td>列表级指标</td>\n<td>文档列表</td>\n<td>LambdaMART, ApproxNDCG</td>\n<td>有多级标注，追求 NDCG</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"特征工程与工业实践\">特征工程与工业实践</h2><p><strong>特征归一化</strong>：树模型（LambdaMART）对特征量纲不敏感，但线性模型需要归一化。</p>\n<p><strong>特征重要性分析</strong>：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"python\" data-code=\"# LightGBM LambdaRank 特征重要性&#10;import lightgbm as lgb&#10;&#10;model = lgb.LGBMRanker(&#10;    objective=&#39;lambdarank&#39;,&#10;    n_estimators=500,&#10;    learning_rate=0.05,&#10;    max_depth=6,&#10;    min_child_samples=20,&#10;    label_gain=[0, 1, 3, 7, 15]  # 4级标注的gain&#10;)&#10;&#10;model.fit(X_train, y_train, group=qid_groups_train)&#10;&#10;# 特征重要性&#10;importances = model.feature_importances_\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># LightGBM LambdaRank 特征重要性</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> lightgbm </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">as</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> lgb</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">model </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> lgb.LGBMRanker(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">    objective</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'lambdarank'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">    n_estimators</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">500</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">    learning_rate</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0.05</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">    max_depth</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">6</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">    min_child_samples</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">20</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">    label_gain</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">[</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">3</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">7</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">15</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">]  </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 4级标注的gain</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">model.fit(X_train, y_train, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">group</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">qid_groups_train)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 特征重要性</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">importances </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> model.feature_importances_</span></span></code></pre></div><p><strong>常见特征重要性排序</strong>（搜索场景经验值）：</p>\n<ol>\n<li>BM25 标题得分（最重要）</li>\n<li>BM25 正文得分</li>\n<li>点击率（CTR）历史数据</li>\n<li>PageRank / 文档权威性</li>\n<li>查询-标题 Embedding 余弦</li>\n<li>用户停留时长</li>\n<li>查询词在 URL 中的覆盖率</li>\n</ol>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li><strong>Pointwise</strong> 简单但不直接优化排序；<strong>Pairwise</strong> 捕获相对偏序；<strong>Listwise</strong> 直接优化 NDCG 等最终指标</li>\n<li><strong>LambdaMART</strong> = LambdaRank 梯度 + GBDT ensemble，是工业界精排层的主流选择（搜索、推荐、广告）</li>\n<li>特征工程质量决定 LTR 上限——BM25 多字段得分、用户行为特征、文档质量特征是三大支柱</li>\n<li>标注数据来源：人工标注（高质量低数量）+ 用户点击（低质量高数量）+ 交织实验（偏差校正）</li>\n</ul>\n<blockquote>\n<p><strong>章内延伸</strong>：神经排序（本章第 3 篇）在 LTR 框架内引入 BERT/ColBERT 特征，或直接端到端训练排序模型；BM25（本章第 1 篇）是 LTR 最重要的基础特征之一。</p>\n</blockquote>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"排序学习 (Learning to Rank)","id":"排序学习-learning-to-rank"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"Pointwise：将排序转化为回归/分类","id":"pointwise-将排序转化为回归-分类"},{"level":2,"text":"Pairwise：从文档对偏序关系学习","id":"pairwise-从文档对偏序关系学习"},{"level":2,"text":"Listwise：直接优化排序指标","id":"listwise-直接优化排序指标"},{"level":2,"text":"特征工程与工业实践","id":"特征工程与工业实践"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"BM25 与 TF-IDF","url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/information-retrieval-fundamentals/ranking/bm25-tfidf"},"next":{"title":"神经排序模型","url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/information-retrieval-fundamentals/ranking/neural-ranking"}}